        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 25S/D9000SAUS32D, Designer Stainless Steel Door Lever Entry Set with Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe contemporary style #25S stainless door lever features the sleek square rose combined with a high security single cylinder square deadbolt makes for a modern entry set. The mounting screws are concealed to complete the clean, contemporary look expected from Omnia door hardware. For use on entry doors or any door that requires a security locking. All the components, including the latch, screws and strike plates are stainless steel. Strong, durable, and beautiful this easy to install lever and deadbolt kit will fit standard pre-drilled doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior. The lever latch operates from either side of door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-57020-SM.jpg?v=1704354615\" width=\"577\" height=\"138\" border=\"0\" alt=\"OMN 12/D9000AUS32D Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching <a href=\"/products/designer-stainless-steel-door-lever-set-with-square-rose-omnia-25s\"><b>Omnia #25S Door Lever Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Omnia Stainless Steel Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Schlage “C” keyway</li>\r\n<li>High Security 1\" Deadbolt with Hardened Steel Core</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable faceplate / armor plate for beveled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Residential and Commercial Doors</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia #25S Stainless Entry Lever Lock Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Diameter (thickness): 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Lever Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Length: 2-3/8\" square</li> \r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt  Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Length: 2-5/16\" square</li> \r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-9/16”</li> \r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 28 Degrees Retraction </li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore</li>\r\n<li>Package Includes: 1 single cylinder deadbolt, 2 passage levers with rosettes, and mounting screws.\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Stainless Steel Entry Lever Set with Square Deadbolt",
                "description": "The contemporary style #25S stainless door lever features the sleek square rose combined with a high security single cylinder square deadbolt makes for a modern entry set. The mounting screws are concealed to complete the clean, contemporary look expected from Omnia door hardware. For use on entry doors or any door that requires a security locking. All the components, including the latch, screws and strike plates are stainless steel. Strong, durable, and beautiful this easy to install lever and deadbolt kit will fit standard pre-drilled doors.\r\n",
